# The method catalogue (GET /insights/methods): one entry per endpoint that the page's panels, the agents' marks
# and the agents themselves use. The assistant only chooses among these fixed methods and writes the words around
# them; every figure on the page is computed by one of them from the official data (Eurostat ds-045409).
#
# The wording follows the page's own catalogue (app/frontend/src/view/methods.ts): the same plain names, the same
# everyday sentences (here without the query's own values), the same technical detail. "plain" is for any reader
# (no "API", no endpoint path); "detail" is for statisticians. tests/test_methods_endpoint.py checks that every
# endpoint of ENDPOINT_PARAMS (app/backend/view/validate.py) has an entry and that its inputs cover its parameters.

